//     0000 0000 0110               0000 0                    000               0000 1            001 0011 
//(immediate value is 6) (value to be added is at x0) (operation is ADD) (result goes in x1) (opcode is i type)
//(transformed into hexadecimal)->
00600093
//     0000 0000 0100               0000 0                    000               0001 0            001 0011 
//(immediate value is 4) (value to be added is at x0) (operation is ADD) (result goes in x2) (opcode is i type)
//(transformed into hexadecimal)->
00400113
//   0000 000                    0 0010                                 0000 1                       111                0001 1            011 0011 
//(confirms AND) (second value to be compared is at x2) (first value to be compared is at x1) (operation is AND) (result goes in x3) (opcode is r type)
//(transformed into hexadecimal)->
0020F1B3
//First function: add 6 to 0, and store in x1
//Second function: add 4 to 0, and store in x2
//Third function: find x1 & x2 (0110 & 0100) and store in x3 (0100)